Changes in this repository
--------------------------
This is a modified version of the upstream snapshot: the build moved from
NetBeans/Ant to Maven, the code was refactored towards Model-View-Presenter, the
Swing/JWinForms front-end (and the original game artwork it loaded) was removed,
and a Lanterna text UI replaced it. The removed front-end and the original image
files remain available in the git history under the tags `upstream-r69` and
`swing-final`.

Artwork
