distributed with the GPL releases of the game. This repository does not ship
those image files in its working tree: they were removed when the Swing
front-end was retired and remain only in the git history of the upstream import
(tags `upstream-r69` and `swing-final`). Artwork added to this project (for
example the planned ASCII ships) is original work of this repository's
contributors and covered by the same license as the code.
